nextui-portmaster-h700
======================

This project is an h700 (Anbernic RG SP / NextUI) repackaging recipe for
PortMaster. The recipe and the h700 compatibility patches in this repository
are licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

At build time the recipe downloads the following upstream components from their
own release/distribution channels. They are NOT redistributed by this
repository and remain under their respective licenses:

- ben16w/minui-portmaster 2.13.0  (MIT)   https://github.com/ben16w/minui-portmaster
- PortMaster                       https://portmaster.games/
- josegonzalez/minui-presenter     (MIT)  https://github.com/josegonzalez/minui-presenter
- Debian bullseye shared libraries (LGPL/BSD/zlib/etc.), via deb.debian.org
- LÖVE 11.5 runtime (zlib), bundled by minui-portmaster

Prebuilt PortMaster.pak release artifacts bundle the above upstream binaries
and preserve their in-pak LICENSE files.
